sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant App as App (phone)
  participant Cat as Catalog
  participant Src as Sources
  participant LR as LRCLIB
  App->>Cat: open(songId)
  Cat->>Src: lyricsFor(song)
  Src->>LR: GET /api/get
  alt no record within 2 s of the duration
    LR-->>Src: 404, or only bad matches
    Src-->>Cat: null
    Cat->>Cat: lyrics missing, fill done, no Chord sheet
    Cat-->>App: pushed: "No lyrics for this Song yet"
  else 429 or 5xx
    LR-->>Src: error, Retry-After
    Src-->>Cat: throws SourceUnavailable(retryAfterMs)
    Cat->>Cat: attempts + 1, schedule retry with backoff
    Cat->>Cat: after 3 attempts: fill failed, retryAt set
    Cat-->>App: pushed: "Could not load, try again later"
    App->>Cat: open(songId) after retryAt
    Cat->>Cat: reschedules the fill
  end
  Note over Cat,Src: a throwing source stops the chain, no fall-through to AI
